  <attributes uuid="1813ba3f-053c-4caa-91e1-8af626e00b10">
    <name>DateOfReceipt</name>
    <synonym>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Date of receipt</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>تاریخ دریافت</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Data di ricezione</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Data wpływu</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Дата поступления</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Giriş tarihi</value>
    </synonym>
    <synonym>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Date of receipt</value>
    </synonym>
    <type>
      <types>Date</types>
      <dateQualifiers>
        <dateFractions>Date</dateFractions>
      </dateQualifiers>
    </type>
    <toolTip>
      <key>en</key>
      <value>Filled in based on the goods receipt date to the warehouse when the lot generation option is by reference. Used for filling in the quality confirmation date when selecting this lot in documents</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>وقتی گزینه ایجاد بچ بر اساس مرجع باشد، بر اساس تاریخ رسید کالا به انبار پر می‌شود. برای پرکردن تاریخ تأیید کیفیت هنگام انتخاب این بچ در اسناد استفاده می‌شود</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Заполняется по дате прихода товаров на склад, в случае, когда вариант формирования партии - по распоряжению. Используется для заполнения даты подтверждения качества, при выборе данной партии в документах</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Lot oluşturma seçeneği emre göre olduğunda, ürünlerin ambara geliş tarihine göre doldurulur. Bu lot belgelerde seçildiğinde kalite onay tarihini doldurmak için kullanılır.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Filled in based on the goods receipt date to the warehouse when the lot generation option is by reference. Used for filling in the quality confirmation date when selecting this lot in documents</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Filled in based on the goods receipt date to the warehouse when the lot generation option is by reference. Used for filling in the quality confirmation date when selecting this lot in documents</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Filled in based on the goods receipt date to the warehouse when the lot generation option is by reference. Used for filling in the quality confirmation date when selecting this lot in documents</value>
    </toolTip>
