      <value>Planned date of unlocking goods at the warehouse after completion of quality control procedures. Used to fill in the same-named attribute when selecting this lot in documents</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>fa</key>
      <value>تاریخ برنامه‌ریزی‌شده رفع قفل کالاها در انبار پس از تکمیل رویه‌های کنترل کیفیت. برای پرکردن ویژگی هم‌نام هنگام انتخاب این بچ در اسناد استفاده می‌شود</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>ru</key>
      <value>Планируемая дата разблокировки товара на складе после выполнения процедур контроля качества. Используется для заполнения одноименного реквизита, при выборе данной партии в документах</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>tr</key>
      <value>Kalite kontrol prosedürleri tamamlandıktan sonra ürünün ambardaki kilidinin kaldırılması için planlanan tarih. Bu lot belgelerde seçildiğinde aynı adlı özniteliği doldurmak için kullanılır.</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>it</key>
      <value>Planned date of unlocking goods at the warehouse after completion of quality control procedures. Used to fill in the same-named attribute when selecting this lot in documents</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>pl</key>
      <value>Planned date of unlocking goods at the warehouse after completion of quality control procedures. Used to fill in the same-named attribute when selecting this lot in documents</value>
    </toolTip>
    <toolTip>
      <key>vi</key>
      <value>Planned date of unlocking goods at the warehouse after completion of quality control procedures. Used to fill in the same-named attribute when selecting this lot in documents</value>
    </toolTip>
